Subject: [PATCH 30/45] inkling2: TF_INKLING2_PROFILE, a round's phases timed
 on each rank

Rank 0 times the lanes calls, the forward apart from the draws (a sync
when on), the steps it sends and the time outside every call; the other
ranks time waiting for a step against running it. A line every 200
rounds; off by default and then free.
